---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import MeetingCard from "../components/MeetingCard.astro";
import DriveYearList from "../components/DriveYearList.astro";
import { site } from "../config";
---

<Base title="Meetings">
  <h1>Meetings</h1>
  <p>
    As a public commission, {site.name} (TRVWD) is subject to the Open Public
    Meetings Act (
    <a
      href="http://apps.leg.wa.gov/RCW/default.aspx?cite=42.30"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
    >
      RCW 42.30
    </a>
    ) and the Open Public Records Act (
    <a
      href="http://apps.leg.wa.gov/RCW/default.aspx?cite=42.56"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
    >
      RCW 42.56
    </a>
    ). TRVWD supports open government and strives to maintain complete
    transparency to the ratepayers and citizens of the Water District.
  </p>

  <MeetingCard />

  <h2>Meeting Information</h2>
  <p>
    TRVWD meetings are open to the public (except for rare executive sessions,{" "}
    <a
      href="http://apps.leg.wa.gov/RCW/default.aspx?cite=42.30.110"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
    >
      RCW 42.30.110
    </a>
    ). We welcome everyone to attend our meetings. Public comments are welcome
    during regular business meeting, but may be limited at the discretion of the
    Commission.
  </p>
  <p>
    Regular meetings of the Water Commission are held on the fourth Tuesday of
    each month, beginning at 6pm, located in the{" "}
    <a
      href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/1665+NE+Tahuya+River+Dr,+Tahuya,+WA+98588/@47.4212847,-122.9742256,236m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m6!3m5!1s0x5491c831cf0cff11:0x11424294f5d50c8d!8m2!3d47.421165!4d-122.973268!16s%2Fg%2F11c27wg_sp?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI0MDkxNi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
    >
      Tahuya River Valley Community Club Building
    </a>{" "}
    unless otherwise noted.
  </p>
  <iframe
    title="Tahuya River Valley Community Club Building"
    src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d2680.168187091775!2d-122.9754146844319!3d47.42128467916486!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x5491c831cf0cff11%3A0x11424294f5d50c8d!2s1665%20NE%20Tahuya%20River%20Dr%2C%20Tahuya%2C%20WA%2098588!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sus!4v1694941550426!5m2!1sen!2sus"
    width="600"
    height="450"
    style="border:0;"
    allowfullscreen=""
    loading="lazy"
    referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"
  ></iframe>

  <h2>Public Records</h2>
  <p>
    TRVWD will make available upon request our public records, except those that
    are exempted under the Open Public Records Act (
    <a
      href="http://apps.leg.wa.gov/RCW/default.aspx?cite=42.56.070"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
    >
      RCW 42.56.070
    </a>
    ). The majority of TRVWD public records are available for download below.
  </p>
  <p>
    If you need a record not listed below, you may submit a public records
    request.
  </p>

  <h3>Meeting Minutes</h3>
  <p>
    Access official meeting minutes and documentation from our commission
    meetings.
  </p>
  <p>
    Minutes are added after they are approved by the commission, which typically
    occurs at the next regular meeting after the meeting to which they pertain.
    For example, minutes from a January meeting would typically be approved at
    the February regular meeting and added to this archive shortly thereafter.
  </p>
  <DriveYearList folderId={site.driveFolders.minutes} title="Meeting minutes" />

  <h3>Resolutions</h3>
  <p>Access official resolutions passed by the commission.</p>
  <DriveYearList folderId={site.driveFolders.resolutions} title="Resolutions" />
</Base>
